/Title (Automatic\040Classification\040of\040Learning\040Objectives\040Based\040on\040\173Bloom\220s\175\040Taxonomy)
/Subject (Learning\040objectives\054\040especially\040those\040well\040defined\040by\040applying\040Bloom\220s\040taxonomy\040for\040Cognitive\040Objectives\054\040have\040been\040widely\040recognized\040as\040important\040in\040various\040teaching\040and\040learning\040practices\056\040However\054\040many\040educators\040have\040difficulties\040developing\040learning\040objectives\040appropriate\040to\040the\040levels\040in\040Bloom\220s\040taxonomy\054\040as\040they\040need\040to\040consider\040the\040progression\040of\040learners\220\040skills\040with\040learning\040content\040as\040well\040as\040dependencies\040between\040different\040learning\040objectives\056\040To\040remedy\040this\040challenge\054\040we\040aimed\040to\040apply\040state\055of\055the\055art\040computational\040techniques\040to\040automate\040the\040classification\040of\040learning\040objectives\040based\040on\040Bloom\220s\040taxonomy\056\040Specifically\054\040we\040collected\04021\054380\040learning\040objectives\040from\0405\054558\040different\040courses\040at\040an\040Australian\040university\040and\040manually\040labeled\040them\040according\040to\040the\040six\040cognitive\040levels\040of\040Bloom\220s\040taxonomy\056\040Based\040on\040the\040labeled\040dataset\054\040we\040applied\040five\040conventional\040machine\040learning\040approaches\040\050i\056e\056\054\040naive\040Bayes\054\040logistic\040regression\054\040support\040vector\040machine\054\040random\040forest\054\040and\040XGBoost\051\040and\040one\040deep\040learning\040approach\040based\040on\040pre\055trained\040language\040model\040BERT\040to\040construct\040classifiers\040to\040automatically\040determine\040a\040learning\040objective\220s\040cognitive\040levels\056\040In\040particular\054\040we\040adopted\040and\040compared\040two\040methods\040in\040constructing\040the\040classifiers\054\040i\056e\056\054\040constructing\040multiple\040binary\040classifiers\040\050one\040for\040each\040cognitive\040level\040in\040Bloom\220s\040taxonomy\051\040and\040constructing\040only\040one\040multi\055class\040multi\055label\040classifier\040to\040simultaneously\040identify\040all\040the\040corresponding\040cognitive\040levels\056\040Through\040extensive\040evaluations\054\040we\040demonstrated\040that\072\040\050i\051\040BERT\055based\040classifiers\040outperformed\040the\040others\040in\040all\040cognitive\040levels\040\050Cohen\220s\040Kappa\040up\040to\0400\05693\040and\040F1\040score\040up\040to\0400\05695\051\073\040\050ii\051\040three\040machine\040learning\040models\040\205\040support\040vector\040machine\054\040random\040forest\054\040and\040XGBoost\040\204\040delivered\040performance\040comparable\040to\040the\040BERT\055based\040classifiers\073\040and\040\050iii\051\040most\040of\040the\040binary\040BERT\055based\040classifiers\040\0505\040out\040of\0406\051\040slightly\040outperformed\040the\040multi\055class\040multi\055label\040BERT\055based\040classifier\054\040suggesting\040that\040separating\040the\040characterization\040of\040different\040cognitive\040levels\040seemed\040to\040be\040a\040better\040choice\040than\040building\040only\040one\040model\040to\040identify\040all\040cognitive\040levels\040at\040one\040time\056)
